<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8" />
	<meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" />
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
	<title>User Account Deletion</title>
</head>

<body style="
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f4f4f4;
      color: #333;
    ">
	<div style="
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 20px;
        background-color: #fff;
        box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      ">
		<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="
          margin: auto;
          max-width: 600px;
          background-color: #fefdf9;
          padding: 20px;
          border-radius: 10px;
          box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        ">
			<tr>
				<td>
					<img src="https://example.com/assets/images/example-1920x720.png" alt="" width="200px"
						height="auto" />
				</td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td style="padding: 20px 0">
					<p style="font-size: 18px; color: #555555">
						Hello {{userName}},
					</p>
					<p style="font-size: 18px; color: #555555">
						We regret to inform you that your admin panel account has been deleted. This action was taken as per your request or due to specific circumstances.
					</p>
				</td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td style="padding: 20px 0">
					<p style="font-size: 18px; color: #555555">
						If you believe this deletion was in error or have any questions or concerns, please contact company support team immediately.
					</p>
					<p style="font-size: 18px; color: #555555">
						We appreciate your usage of our admin panel.
					</p>
					<p style="font-size: 18px; color: #555555">Best regards,</p>
					<p style="font-size: 18px; color: #555555">Example Team</p>
				</td>
			</tr>
		</table>
	</div>
</body>

</html>

